### Time & Space Complexity

- Time complexity: $O((n * t ^ 2) + m)$
- Space complexity: $O(n + (m * t))$

> Where $n$ is the length of the string $s$, $m$ is the number of words in $wordDict$ and $t$ is the maximum length of any word in $wordDict$.

